WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.109
This is Centaur.

2
00:00:02.735 --> 00:00:07.163
Cody's demonstration with Northfield Logistics has just finished on Microsoft Teams.

3
00:00:08.112 --> 00:00:10.049
Let's see what Centaur's Scribe does next.

4
00:00:11.733 --> 00:00:13.452
Cody doesn't write a single note.

5
00:00:14.093 --> 00:00:17.680
When the call ends, the Scribe reads the transcript Teams made,

6
00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:18.990
and writes up the call.

7
00:00:20.057 --> 00:00:21.952
It's saved on the deal as a call summary.

8
00:00:22.834 --> 00:00:23.985
What the call was about.

9
00:00:24.329 --> 00:00:25.130
The key points.

10
00:00:26.181 --> 00:00:27.012
The next steps.

11
00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:30.253
And a list of every change it made to the CRM.

12
00:00:31.602 --> 00:00:33.588
Because it also picks up the details.

13
00:00:34.538 --> 00:00:37.988
Northfield need twenty five users, and Marcus confirmed the budget.

14
00:00:38.739 --> 00:00:41.500
Those go straight into the deal and its qualification.

15
00:00:42.294 --> 00:00:46.029
And Priya's request for a proposal by Friday is there in the next steps.

16
00:00:47.201 --> 00:00:50.330
Like every Centaur agent, it only fills in what's blank.

17
00:00:51.304 --> 00:00:54.848
If Cody has already entered something, the Scribe leaves it alone.

18
00:00:55.927 --> 00:00:58.220
It matches the people on the call to your contacts.

19
00:00:58.903 --> 00:01:03.149
Northfield's operations lead joined the call, and she isn't in the CRM yet.

20
00:01:03.943 --> 00:01:06.654
So the Scribe adds a card in AI Activity,

21
00:01:06.654 --> 00:01:09.563
and Cody adds her as a contact in one click.

22
00:01:10.969 --> 00:01:13.814
And the summary is there for the rest of Centaur to use.

23
00:01:14.583 --> 00:01:17.054
The Briefer and the reply drafts both read it,

24
00:01:17.054 --> 00:01:20.169
so the next email to Marcus already knows what was agreed.

25
00:01:21.039 --> 00:01:22.195
Centaur CRM.

26
00:01:22.872 --> 00:01:25.908
Your calls, written up and filed, before you've closed Teams.

27
00:01:26.773 --> 00:01:30.317
Book a demonstration today, at centaurcrm.com.

